# An opponent with no nonland permanent and no card in hand can neither sacrifice nor discard, so loses 4 life, and is asked
# nothing (CR 608.2c). Bot2 mulligans to one card (CR 103.5). Bot1's Show and Tell puts Rottenmouth Viper onto the
# battlefield on turn 1: one blight counter, and Bot2 discards its one card. On turn 2 Bot2 plays the Island it drew - a land,
# not a nonland permanent - and has nothing left. On turn 3 the Viper attacks with two counters, and for each Bot2 loses 4
# life unasked; then its 6 damage: 20 - 8 - 6 = 6.

[Opening]
Chooser: Bot1

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Rottenmouth Viper
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

